A developer sends a Messages API request whose `container` lists a Skill:

```json
{
  "container": {
    "skills": [{"type": "anthropic", "skill_id": "xlsx", "version": "latest"}]
  },
  "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Build a budget workbook"}]
}
```

What else must the request include for the Skill to run?

A team's agent only needs to read channels and search messages through a Slack MCP server. The OAuth grant it receives also allows posting and managing channels. The server is configured like this:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "slack": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "https://mcp.slack.com/mcp"
    }
  }
}
```

Which change limits the permissions of the grant itself?
